// Recently Viewed Full History (5) — same `variation:'plp'` code path as PLP above, own stories,
// not aliased. See `../index.tsx`'s own module docblock: "Recently Viewed Full History" is not a
// fourth variation — the AC states it behaves exactly like PLP, so callers pass `variation:'plp'`
// for it.

/**
 * Recently Viewed AC1 — same as PLP AC1: "default state: image, name, badge, price, cart icon
 * visible." Same code path as PLP AC1 — this variation has no dedicated code, `variation:'plp'`
 * is used for it per the ticket's own ACs.
